### 2 cli render trip.x.md --format text
$ xmd render trip.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-17T14:00:00+00:00
exit 0
--- stdout
# Planning ahead

last_daily := forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-10-02) = 24°C / 12°C · light rain · 40% rain
first_seasonal := forecast("Oaxaca", 2026-10-03, F) = 77°F / 57°F · seasonal outlook (estimate) · 50% rain
next_year := forecast("Oaxaca", 2027-01-20) = 22°C / 10°C · seasonal outlook (estimate)
pack_rain_jacket := first_seasonal.rain > 30% = true
dry := next_year.rain = 0%
too_far := forecast("Oaxaca", 2027-05-20)

## Wednesday, January 20, 2027 · Oaxaca 0 stops · in 125 days · 22°C / 10°C · seasonal outlook (estimate)
